ika 1  was a corpse not the greatest of  outcomes but a beautiful portrayal of  revenge and action  as well as one of my favorite fight  scenes in all of media from togashi but  what do you guys think please do leave  your thoughts in the comments below or  even join my discord server and if  you're game for some more hunt  hunt content then please do go and check  out some of my other videos or even  subscribe to the channel the regular  hunt on to glory delivered straight into  your youtube feed but for now this has  been the new world review and i'll see  you next time

